<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor market interest</p>
<p>rates were flat at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate was unchanged at 3.35 percent.</p>
<p>					Sept 6 fix	    Sept 5 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.25 pct		3.25 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.30 pct		3.30 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.35 pct		3.35 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.51 pct		3.50 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.64 pct		3.64 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.76 pct		3.76 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
